{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41198","headline":"清明登奉先城楼 · 罗衮","name":"清明登奉先城楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年来年去只艰危，春半尧山草尚衰。\n四海清平耆旧见，五陵寒食小臣悲。\n烟销井邑隈楼槛，雪满川原泥酒巵。\n拭尽贾生无限泪，一行归雁远参差。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41198.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41198","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}